{
  "description": "`sdk-python/run/complete-error-details.json` played by a Collie Daemon: the same steps, the Python Client's hello carrying the Daemon's token. A Run started and a page opened in it (ADRs 0092 and 0114): a fill of the `shop_totp` placeholder fails with `secret_unavailable`, `failure: \"no_code\"`, and a click with `page_navigated_during_call`, naming both documents and the fix, which no call of this protocol sends yet, so a click carries it; then two navigations fail with `blocked`, one for `rate_limit` with the site's time and one for a cause no catalog names; the Run then finishes. The `complete-error-details` client conformance case, played as a Daemon.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "hello",
        "params": {
          "protocol_version": "0.1",
          "surface": "sdk_python",
          "form": "python",
          "needs": "collie",
          "product_version": "0.0.0",
          "log_level": "warn",
          "token": "scripted-daemon-token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "result": {
          "protocol_version": "0.1",
          "product": "collie",
          "product_version": "0.0.0",
          "engine_instance": "0123456789abcdef"
        }
      }
    },
    { "expect": { "method": "run.start", "params": {} } },
    {
      "reply": {
        "result": {
          "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc",
          "lifecycle": "running",
          "needs": "collie",
          "started_as": "new"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "expect": { "method": "run.new_page", "params": { "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc" } }
    },
    { "reply": { "result": { "page_id": "page-1", "session_id": "session-1" } } },
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "locator.fill",
        "params": { "locator": { "page_id": "page-1", "selector": "#otp" }, "value": "%shop_totp%" }
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": -32006,
          "message": "the Secret reference bw:shop/totp gave no one-time code: Bitwarden made none from the item's seed",
          "data": {
            "code": "secret_unavailable",
            "retryable": false,
            "operation": "locator.fill",
            "call_id": "call-1",
            "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc",
            "target": "#otp",
            "url": "https://shop.test/login",
            "placeholder": "shop_totp",
            "reference": "bw:shop/totp",
            "provider": "bw",
            "failure": "no_code",
            "fix": "Check the TOTP seed of the vault's shop item"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "locator.click",
        "params": { "locator": { "page_id": "page-1", "selector": "#book" } }
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": -32003,
          "message": "a navigation the call did not start replaced https://travel.test/books with https://travel.test/books/1",
          "data": {
            "code": "page_navigated_during_call",
            "retryable": true,
            "operation": "locator.click",
            "call_id": "call-2",
            "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc",
            "target": "#book",
            "url": "https://travel.test/books",
            "navigated_to": "https://travel.test/books/1",
            "fix": "Await the Collie call before your driver acts on the page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "page.goto",
        "params": { "page_id": "page-1", "url": "https://shop.test/deals" }
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": -32003,
          "message": "the site refused https://shop.test/deals with the Block cause rate_limit (HTTP 429)",
          "data": {
            "code": "blocked",
            "retryable": false,
            "operation": "page.goto",
            "call_id": "call-3",
            "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc",
            "url": "https://shop.test/deals",
            "cause": "rate_limit",
            "status": 429,
            "retry_after": "2026-11-21T10:00:00+02:00"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "expect": {
        "method": "page.goto",
        "params": { "page_id": "page-1", "url": "https://shop.test/abroad" }
      }
    },
    {
      "reply": {
        "error": {
          "code": -32003,
          "message": "the site refused https://shop.test/abroad with the Block cause geo_block (HTTP 451)",
          "data": {
            "code": "blocked",
            "retryable": false,
            "operation": "page.goto",
            "call_id": "call-4",
            "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc",
            "url": "https://shop.test/abroad",
            "cause": "geo_block",
            "status": 451,
            "retry_after": null
          }
        }
      }
    },
    { "expect": { "method": "run.finish", "params": { "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc" } } },
    {
      "reply": {
        "result": {
          "run_id": "01ke6p4ym0j8x3v5wq2rtbn7hc",
          "lifecycle": "finished",
          "verdict": "verified",
          "completeness": "complete",
          "started_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
